{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22957","headline":"送友人上峡赴东川辟命 · 白居易","name":"送友人上峡赴东川辟命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见说瞿塘峡，斜衔灩澦根。\n难於寻鸟路，险过上龙门。\n羊角风头急，桃花水色浑。\n山回若鳌转，舟入似鲸吞。\n岸合愁天断，波跳恐地翻。\n怜君经此去，爲感主人恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}